    "Declared narrowing: the full app-shell suite (1082 test files; ledger shows 25-47 min lock holds, past the foreground cap) is left to CI. Local set = every app-shell test naming DashboardDefaultInspector / dashboard-schema / getDashboardForm / register-builtins / default-inspector-registry, plus ResourceEditPage / StudioDesignSurface / inspector tests mounting a dashboard: 42 files, 304 tests (9957feb), green again inside the 132 on bf2a3ba. Positive control DashboardDefaultInspector.test.tsx is in the set.",
